rn that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"type":"topic","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"}}}